      cat ]]; then \\\"$pager\\\" \\\"$file\\\"; else cat \\\"$file\\\"; fi\\n}\\n\\nshow_help()
      {\\n cat <<'HELP'\\nMSW — grouped MicroSandbox development workspaces\\n\\nEnter / edit\\n msw
      dev [PATH] Ghostty/SSH shell in dev\\n msw playgrounds [PATH] Shell in playgrounds\\n msw
      personal [PATH] Shell in personal\\n msw zed WORKSPACE [PATH] Open workspace/repository in
      Zed\\n msw exec WORKSPACE COMMAND... Run a command in /workspace\\n\\nRepositories\\n msw
