      cation-related-actions)\nciteturn0search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Actionable
      notifications let the user respond to a notification directly from the notification interface.
      ... You handle selected actions from the delegate object of the shared
      `UNUserNotificationCenter` object.\nIf your app supports actionable notification types, you
