      Retrieve the meeting details.\n let meetingID = userInfo[\"MEETING_ID\"] as! String\n let
      userID = userInfo[\"USER_ID\"] as! String\n \n switch response.actionIdentifier {\n\nIf a
      notification arrives when your app is running in the foreground, the system delivers that
      notification directly to your app. Upon receiving a notification, you can use the
      notification’s payload to do whatever you want. For example, you can update your app’s
      interface to reflect new information contained in the notification. You can then suppress any
      scheduled alerts or modify those alerts.\n\nWhen a notification arrives, the system calls the
