      let the system know how you want it to proceed. Listing 2 shows a version of this method for a
      calendar app. When a meeting invitation arrives, the app calls its custom
      `queueMeetingForDelivery` method to show the new invitation in the app’s interface. The app
      also asks the system to play the notification’s sound by passing the `sound` value to the
      completion handler. For other notification types, the method silences the
