      `getDeliveredNotificationsWithCompletionHandler:` method to retrieve those objects.\n\n#
      UNNotification\n\nThe data for a local or remote notification the system delivers to your
      app.\n \n `@interface UNNotification : `NSObject``\n\n## Overview\n\nA `UNNotification` object
      contains the initial notification request, which contains the notification’s payload, and the
      date that the system delivered the notification.\n\nDon’t create notification objects
